  (text "SAO++ power select: the switch common feeds the LEDs. Position 1 = badge 3.3 V, position 2 = OFF (pin 2 unconnected), position 3 = coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91e584a6-9bb8-525c-a2ff-b6bc6740c521"))
  (text "The badge supply and the coin cell sit on separate switch contacts and are never connected to each other." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0dd04333-f150-5df7-8a56-a9c114bce4f7"))
  (text "LED-only board: SDA, SCL, GPIO1 and GPIO2 are not connected, so no series diode is needed on the cell (see docs/standard.md section 3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e62d378b-0af4-5f44-9955-10a44c5569f5"))
  (text "D1 to D3 light the three 7s from behind. One 1.3k resistor per red LED: about 1.1 mA each on badge power, about 0.85 mA each on a fresh cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 120.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cad36875-00f6-57b5-ad7d-604a056c59ed"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
